{"seq":2,"slug":"virtual-tryon-recommendation-interaction","title":"虚拟试穿与尺码推荐交互","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/apparel-size-fit-recommendation-returns-reduction/tryon-guidance-ux/virtual-tryon-recommendation-interaction","wordCount":3133,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"虚拟试穿与尺码推荐交互\">虚拟试穿与尺码推荐交互</h1><p>在商品详情页放一个「推荐你穿 M」的标签，和放一个「点这里看看你穿上什么样」的按钮，是两种完全不同性质的干预。前者给的是<strong>几何判断</strong>——这件衣服的成衣尺寸与你的身体尺寸是否相容；后者给的是<strong>外观想象</strong>——这件衣服穿在你身上大概长什么样。把两者混为一谈，是 2025–2026 年大量服饰电商试穿功能上线后收益低于预期的头号原因：用户点开生成图觉得好看而下单，收货时发现肩线差了三厘米，退货理由仍然是「尺码不合适」。本文拆解这条交互链路的工程结构；退货数据如何回流修正模型见《<a href=\"../size-data-fit-model/fit-model-evaluation-bias-correction\">合身模型评估与偏差校正</a>》。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两个信号-一条链路\">核心概念：两个信号，一条链路</h2><p>交互层要同时交付两种不可互换的信号。**尺码推荐（size recommendation）**输出离散尺码上的概率分布，正确性由「用户收到后是否保留」验证，本质是分类/排序问题。**虚拟试穿（virtual try-on）**输出像素，正确性由「用户是否觉得这张图像自己、像这件衣服」验证，本质是生成问题。二者共用同一套输入，但目标函数、失败模式、成本结构完全不同。混淆的直接后果是：用生成图的点击率去证明尺码推荐的准确性，而两者之间没有因果关系。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;入口曝光&lt;br/&gt;PDP 尺码选择器 / Try It On 按钮&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;用户是否有体型数据?&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt;|无| C[&quot;冷启动采集&lt;br/&gt;身高体重 → 追加体围&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|有| D[&quot;读取体型档案&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;推理服务&lt;br/&gt;合身概率 + 生成图像&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;结果呈现&lt;br/&gt;尺码条 + 试穿图&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G{&quot;用户是否采纳?&quot;}&#10;  G --&gt;|采纳| H[&quot;下单&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt;|忽略| I[&quot;自行选码&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; J[&quot;收货反馈&lt;br/&gt;保留 / 退货 / 换码&quot;]&#10;  I --&gt; J&#10;  J --&gt; K[&quot;标签回流&lt;br/&gt;修正模型与呈现&quot;]&#10;  K --&gt; E\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"入口曝光&lt;br/&gt;PDP 尺码选择器 / Try It On 按钮\"] --&gt; B{\"用户是否有体型数据?\"}\n  B --&gt;|无| C[\"冷启动采集&lt;br/&gt;身高体重 → 追加体围\"]\n  B --&gt;|有| D[\"读取体型档案\"]\n  C --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E[\"推理服务&lt;br/&gt;合身概率 + 生成图像\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"结果呈现&lt;br/&gt;尺码条 + 试穿图\"]\n  F --&gt; G{\"用户是否采纳?\"}\n  G --&gt;|采纳| H[\"下单\"]\n  G --&gt;|忽略| I[\"自行选码\"]\n  H --&gt; J[\"收货反馈&lt;br/&gt;保留 / 退货 / 换码\"]\n  I --&gt; J\n  J --&gt; K[\"标签回流&lt;br/&gt;修正模型与呈现\"]\n  K --&gt; E</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>尺码推荐</th>\n<th>生成式虚拟试穿</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输出</td>\n<td>尺码 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 上的概率分布</td>\n<td>一张（或数张）图像</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输入敏感性</td>\n<td>对体围数值误差敏感（±2 cm 可跨码）</td>\n<td>对照片质量/角度敏感，对数值不敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败模式</td>\n<td>推荐偏差导致退货（<strong>有成本</strong>）</td>\n<td>图像失真导致信任崩塌（<strong>损伤会话</strong>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单位成本</td>\n<td>一次前向推理，亚毫秒到毫秒级</td>\n<td>一次扩散采样，秒级 + GPU 成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>验证口径</td>\n<td>keep rate / 退货率变化</td>\n<td>生成图保存率、分享率、会话时长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可直接驱动下单</td>\n<td>是（可预选尺码）</td>\n<td>否（需用户自行判断）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Google 在 2025-07-24 面向美国上线了在自己的虚拟身体上试穿的功能，覆盖 Search、Google Shopping 与 Google Images 中的 Shopping Graph 商品；2025-10-08 扩展到澳大利亚、加拿大、日本并支持鞋类；2025-12-11 进一步支持仅用一张自拍生成全身试穿图，底层是 Gemini 2.5 Flash Image（Nano Banana）模型（Google，经 TechCrunch 报道）。生成侧的迭代远快于推荐侧——生成质量提升是连续可见的，推荐质量提升只能靠退货率这种滞后指标验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"输入采集的交互阶梯\">输入采集的交互阶梯</h2><p>推荐质量的方差，超过一半来自输入数据的完整性而非模型本身。交互层的核心任务是：<strong>用最小的摩擦换到足以定码的信息</strong>，并在信息不足时诚实降低置信度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>采集内容</th>\n<th>放弃率影响</th>\n<th>可支撑的推荐精度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L0 零输入</td>\n<td>仅商品页默认码</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>全局众数码，接近瞎猜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L1 三问</td>\n<td>身高、体重、常穿码</td>\n<td>低（约 10 秒）</td>\n<td>标准体型可用，高/矮/胖/瘦偏差大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 体围</td>\n<td>胸围、腰围、臀围（自报）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>显著提升，但受自报误差污染</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 引导量体</td>\n<td>带图示的自量流程</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>自报误差可控，需回访数据修正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4 历史行为</td>\n<td>买过/退过哪些码</td>\n<td>无（后台）</td>\n<td>个性化上限最高，冷启动无数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L5 三维扫描</td>\n<td>多帧重建或深度传感器</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>几何最准，渗透率长期偏低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>正确做法不是把 L5 当作目标，而是<strong>分层激活</strong>：L1 保证新用户当下就拿到可用结果，随后通过「这件衣服你是偏紧还是偏松穿」这类单个二选一问题，把 L1 提升到接近 L2 的判别力。Amazon 在 2024-01-08 公布的方案里，个性化尺码推荐是深度学习算法，实时组合品牌尺码系统对应关系、商品评论与用户合身偏好并自适应；同一发布里还有面向卖家的 Fit Insights 工具与重做的尺码表。</p>\n<p>两个必须内建在交互里的约束。第一是<strong>同意的粒度</strong>：体型数据与本人照片在欧盟 GDPR 语境下需要明确的处理依据与告知，用户必须能删除原始照片与生成图像。第二是<strong>尺码系统的显式化</strong>：同一件商品在德国站标 <code>38</code>、美国站标 <code>M</code>、日本站标 <code>M</code> 或 <code>9</code>，交互层若不把用户所处尺码系统当作显式输入，推荐会系统性偏码。尺码字段如何被结构化成可比较的度量，见《<a href=\"../product-attribute-size-ontology/apparel-size-ontology-schema\">服装尺码本体与属性 Schema 设计</a>》。</p>\n<h2 id=\"尺码推荐的呈现与置信度\">尺码推荐的呈现与置信度</h2><p>漏掉置信度的推荐等于把模型的不确定性藏起来，让用户用确定的姿态接受不确定的建议。正确的呈现是<strong>按合身概率排序的整条尺码条</strong>，而非孤立的一个标签。设商品在尺码 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 上的成衣测量值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，用户对应身体维度的净体值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，该品类该版型所需的最小宽松量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，余量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m(s) = g_s - b - e_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为正表示这件衣服在该维度上容得下用户；经由温度参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 映射为合身概率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>fit</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>τ</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(\\text{fit} \\mid s) = \\sigma\\!\\left(\\frac{m(s)}{\\tau}\\right), \\qquad \\sigma(z) = \\frac{1}{1 + e^{-z}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fit</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0908em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6973em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 编码品类的容错度：弹性针织的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 大，概率曲线平坦，相邻码差别小；定制西装的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 小，曲线陡峭，半码之差就是灾难。推荐不取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 最大者就结束，而引入退货成本的期望效用：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mstyle mathcolor=\"#cc0000\"><mtext>\\*</mtext></mstyle></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>fit</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>return</mtext></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>fit</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s^\\* = \\arg\\max_{s \\in S}\\left[\\, p(\\text{fit} \\mid s) - \\lambda \\, C_{\\text{return}} \\left(1 - p(\\text{fit} \\mid s)\\right) \\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">\\*</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5217em;vertical-align:-0.7717em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7717em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">[</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fit</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">return</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fit</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>return</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{return}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">return</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是归一化后的退货成本（逆向物流、翻新、二次销售折价），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是运营方对退货的厌恶系数。跨境场景里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>return</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{return}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">return</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 常远高于国内——一单从美国退回中国仓的运费可能吞掉全部毛利，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 应显著调高。现实含义是：<strong>两个尺码合身概率接近时，系统应推荐更宽松的那个</strong>，因为偏大的退货率低于偏小。</p>\n<p>三个具体呈现设计。<strong>首选 + 备选双呈现</strong>：给出首选码与次高码并标注方向（「M 合身概率 0.78；若偏好宽松，选 L」），让用户做偏好选择而不是概率判断。<strong>品牌偏码提示</strong>：当用户历史在该品牌的保留码与推荐码系统性相差一码时，展示「这个品牌的 M 相当于其他品牌的 S」。<strong>反馈即时化</strong>：采纳后立刻记录「接受了推荐/改选了 X」，这是后续偏差校正最干净的样本来源。</p>\n<p>推荐接口契约应把概率与原因一并交付；中间层若把它压成一个字符串，交互层就再也无法渲染尺码条或展示理由。最小契约包含推荐码、次高码及方向（<code>prefer_loose</code>）、完整分布、品牌偏码量与置信度；<code>confidence</code> 不可由模型自报，须由输入级别（L0–L5）与首位概率共同决定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生成式试穿的工程现实与幻觉风险\">生成式试穿的工程现实与幻觉风险</h2><p>生成式试穿在 2025–2026 年最大的陷阱是：<strong>它看起来太真了，因此用户把它当作合身证据</strong>。扩散模型的输出在几何上并不可靠——图案方向可能翻转、logo 可能被重绘、面料透明度可能被臆造、衣长可能被拉伸到模特比例好看为止。用户不会分辨这些细节，只记住「穿上很好看」，然后收到实物时失望。这与推荐错误是不同的失败：推荐错误直接产生退货，生成错误产生的是<strong>未被记录的错误期望</strong>。</p>\n<p>工程上的三条防线。第一，<strong>明示功能边界</strong>：试穿图旁必须有稳定的说明文字，表明这是效果预览而非尺码依据。Google 在推出自己虚拟身体试穿之前，早期方案是把商品展示在一组不同体型的模特身上；切换到用户自己的身体是 2025 年的事，两个阶段的产品语义并不相同。</p>\n<p>第二，<strong>延迟与成本的显式预算</strong>。生成一次需秒级时间与 GPU 成本，而商品页在移动端的等待容忍通常只有数秒。可行架构是：尺码推荐同步返回（毫秒级，直接预选尺码条），生成图异步返回（先占位、后填充），用户在等待期已拿到可决策的推荐。第三方模型路径也需评估——Google 侧底层是 Gemini 2.5 Flash Image，OpenAI 在 2026-10-01 上线 ChatGPT 试穿功能并标注底层为 ChatGPT Images 2.5。</p>\n<p>第三，<strong>每 SKU 的素材覆盖</strong>。生成质量强依赖商品图的规范性——白底、正面平铺、无遮挡。跨境卖家的实拍图大量不符合要求，直接导致生成结果退化；上线顺序应当是先在素材合规度高的 SKU 上开放入口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"信任-采纳与反馈闭环\">信任、采纳与反馈闭环</h2><p>一个离线准确率很高的推荐，如果采纳率只有 12%，对退货率的改善接近于零。<strong>被看到</strong>取决于入口设计：藏在尺码选择器浮层里，曝光量会低一个数量级；做成商品主图上方的常驻尺码条，曝光量高但会干扰浏览。取舍必须靠实验而非直觉，并监控一个反向指标——尺码条曝光是否显著降低了「查看尺码表」的行为。<strong>被理解</strong>取决于理由的呈现：只给码数与给出「你的胸围 96，这件 M 的胸围 102，松量 6 厘米」，采纳率差异显著；理由本身也是校验入口，用户若知道自己偏好 10 厘米以上，会自行上选一码。<strong>被信任</strong>会随错误累积而衰减，一次离谱的推荐足以让用户永久关闭该功能，因此置信度低时<strong>宁可不推</strong>。</p>\n<p>反馈闭环的指标设计要防止自我欺骗。把采纳率单独作为优化目标，会诱导系统只在高置信人群上展示推荐，刷高采纳率却不改善整体退货。正确做法是<strong>分层监控</strong>：按输入级别分层，分别看采纳率、keep rate 与退货率，只允许在整体退货率不上升的前提下提升采纳率。这与《<a href=\"../size-data-fit-model/size-chart-fit-prediction-model\">尺码表与合身预测模型</a>》描述的合身概率输出是同一套数据契约的两端。</p>\n<p>跨境场景还叠加两项交互成本。<strong>尺码系统认知</strong>：用户对「38」「M」「9 号」的直觉来自本地市场，欧洲最大的时尚电商 Zalando 覆盖 30 个市场、约 6200 万活跃用户，同一商品在不同站点展示的尺码系统并不一致，推荐必须绑定用户当前站点的系统。<strong>退货运费预期</strong>：退货自付跨境运费时容忍度急剧下降，因此退货成本高的市场里最低置信度门槛应更高。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>尺码推荐与生成式试穿是两种信号：前者驱动决策、错误直接产生退货；后者驱动想象、错误损伤信任。共用输入，但目标函数、成本结构与验证口径都不同，指标不可互换。</li>\n<li>输入采集是一条 L0–L5 的阶梯，工程目标不是爬到最高级，而是分层激活、并诚实反映当前输入级别能支撑的置信度。</li>\n<li>尺码推荐应在余量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m(s) = g_s - b - e_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 上建立合身概率，并按期望效用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mstyle mathcolor=\"#cc0000\"><mtext>\\*</mtext></mstyle></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>return</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s^\\* = \\arg\\max_s [p - \\lambda C_{\\text{return}}(1-p)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">\\*</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">return</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span> 决策；偏大退货率低于偏小，概率接近时应偏向宽松码。</li>\n<li>呈现必须携带概率、方向与理由并如实标注置信度；生成式试穿需明示「效果预览而非尺码依据」，用异步生成保住首屏延迟。</li>\n<li>采纳率必须与 keep rate、退货率分层联合监控，否则会诱导系统只在易推人群中展示推荐。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"虚拟试穿与尺码推荐交互","id":"虚拟试穿与尺码推荐交互"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两个信号，一条链路","id":"核心概念-两个信号-一条链路"},{"level":2,"text":"输入采集的交互阶梯","id":"输入采集的交互阶梯"},{"level":2,"text":"尺码推荐的呈现与置信度","id":"尺码推荐的呈现与置信度"},{"level":2,"text":"生成式试穿的工程现实与幻觉风险","id":"生成式试穿的工程现实与幻觉风险"},{"level":2,"text":"信任、采纳与反馈闭环","id":"信任-采纳与反馈闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"合身问答与体型画像采集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/apparel-size-fit-recommendation-returns-reduction/tryon-guidance-ux/fit-quiz-body-profile-capture"},"next":{"title":"推荐解释、信任与反馈闭环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/apparel-size-fit-recommendation-returns-reduction/tryon-guidance-ux/recommendation-explanation-feedback-loop"}}